{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "At the Restaurant"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "An Evening With Friends"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > World of Food > Talking Around Food"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information, involving apologies, thanks, suggestions and invitations in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making Plans for the Evening"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use modals or the simple present tense to make offers and invitations, such as <span class = \"italic\">\"Would you like to \u2026 ?\"</span> or  <span class = \"italic\">\"Do you feel like \u2026 ?\"<br/> You can also use modals and the simple present tense to accept or decline invitations."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Making Offers</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Accepting</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Declining</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Do you feel like \u2026 ?</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Would you like to \u2026 ?</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">We should</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Sure!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Great idea!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">That sounds good!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">I would love to!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I would love to, but \u2026</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Thanks for the offer, but \u2026</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">No, thanks. I don't feel like \u2026 </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br/> In polite conversations, it is important to thank people when you accept their invitation.<br/>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Thanking People</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Responding to Thanks</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Formal</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Thank you so much!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">You shouldn't have!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">This is really kind/sweet of you!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">My pleasure.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">You're very welcome.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Don't mention it!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Informal</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Thanks!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Cheers!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Sure.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">No problem.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">No worries.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">It's nothing.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use expressions like <span class = \"italic\">\"I'm sorry\"</span> to apologize if you refuse an invitation."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Apologizing</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Responding to Apologies</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Sorry / So sorry \u2026</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">I'm sorry to hear that.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">I apologize \u2026</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Don't worry about it!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">It's ok.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">That's okay.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">No problem.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Maybe next time!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use verbs with infinitives to be more specific about the reason for accepting or refusing an offer:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm sorry. I can't make it because I have to go to the doctor."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I would love to come to the party."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "most of the time"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very often; usually"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I eat at home most of the time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you make plans for the evening."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "every other day"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "one day out of two"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I go to yoga every other day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cheese"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a solid food made from milk"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The 4-cheese pizza is delicious."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "topping"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "food that you put on top of a dish"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Pepperoni is my favorite pizza topping."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "romantic comedy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a movie about love relationships"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love romantic comedies because they're not depressing!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "depressing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "sad"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't like depressing movies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "blockbuster"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a very popular movie"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Avatar is my favorite blockbuster."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "My pleasure! "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "You are welcome."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Charlie</span> : Thank you for dinner!  <span class=\"strong\">Dave</span>: My pleasure!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob11aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "practice"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "regular training"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": 